        this.Text("Kdsp-Job-JOB_BD_EDITOR_SWEATSHOP", "Edited BDs in a Kabuki sweatshop. Twelve-hour shifts inside other people's worst days. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Job-JOB_AV_TRAFFIC", "Worked AV traffic control for the city. One mistake is a headline. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Job-JOB_BODY_BANK", "Clerked at a body bank. Learned not to read the intake forms too closely. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Job-JOB_RIPPERDOC_ASSIST", "Assisted a ripperdoc. Held the tray, cleaned the chrome, kept the secrets. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Job-JOB_NCPD_EVIDENCE", "Worked the NCPD evidence room. Knows exactly what goes missing and when. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Job-JOB_VENDING_RESTOCK", "Restocked vending machines across Watson. Robbed eleven times. Company kept a counter. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Job-JOB_NOODLE_STAND", "Ran a noodle stand outside a corpo plaza. Knew every regular's order by heart. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Job-JOB_DELAMAIN_DEPOT", "Worked maintenance at a Delamain depot. The cabs talk to you if you work alone at night. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Job-JOB_SCREAMSHEET", "Wrote for a screamsheet. Made up half the quotes. Nobody ever checked. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Job-JOB_CORPO_CONTRACTOR_CHURN", "Third corpo contract in two years. Badge changes, cubicle doesn't. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Job-JOB_DATA_JANITOR", "Worked as a data janitor, scrubbing NET archives of things corps wanted forgotten. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Job-JOB_CROWD_EXTRA", "Paid crowd extra for BD shoots. Professional bystander. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Job-JOB_ORGAN_COURIER", "Couriered medical cargo across town. Never opened the cooler. Never asked. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Job-JOB_TOWING_COMBAT", "Drove a tow truck in the combat zone. Hazard pay barely covered the armor plating. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Job-JOB_CLINIC_NIGHT", "Night receptionist at a document-free clinic. Saw everything, remembered nothing. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Job-JOB_SYNTH_MEAT", "Line worker at a synth-meat plant. Hasn't eaten a burger since. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Job-JOB_NEON_REPAIR", "Repaired neon signage across Japantown. The city looks different from a cherry picker at 3 AM. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Job-JOB_DEBT_COLLECTOR_CALLS", "Worked phone collections for a lending app. Quit when they added the family-contact script. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Job-JOB_ARCADE_TECH", "Fixed arcade cabinets in Kabuki. Half the machines are older than the customers. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Job-JOB_FUNERAL_TECH", "Prepped bodies at a columbarium services firm. Steady work. Always steady work. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Job-JOB_WATER_RECLAIM", "Shift tech at a water reclamation plant. The city drinks because of people nobody thanks. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Job-JOB_CORPO_GYM", "Front desk at a corpo-only gym. Watched executives scream into phones on treadmills. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Job-JOB_PAWN_COUNTER", "Worked a pawnshop counter. Learned to price desperation. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Job-JOB_STREET_FOOD_CART", "Ran a food cart without a permit. Outran health inspectors twice. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Job-JOB_MAGLEV_CLEANER", "Cleaned NCART maglev cars overnight. Found things people would kill to get back. Left them alone. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Job-JOB_DRONE_WRANGLER", "Recovered crashed delivery drones for a logistics firm. Half the job is fighting scavs to the wreck. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Job-JOB_HOLO_AD_TECH", "Serviced holographic billboards. The city's dreams run on scaffolding and bad wiring. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Job-JOB_TRANSLATOR_STREET", "Freelance translator for street deals. Neutral party, paid by both sides. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Job-JOB_KIBBLE_QA", "Quality control at a kibble factory. There is no quality. There is only control. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Job-JOB_PARKING_ENFORCEMENT", "Wrote parking citations in Heywood. Most dangerous job in the city, per capita. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Lp-SK_WATSON_NATIVE", "Born and raised in Watson. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Lp-SK_HEYWOOD_NATIVE", "Grew up in the barrios of Heywood. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Lp-SK_PACIFICA_SURVIVOR", "Survived childhood in the ruins of Pacifica. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Lp-SK_GANG_FAMILY", "Born into a family with deep gang ties. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Lp-SK_ORPHAN_STREET", "Orphaned young, learned to survive on the streets. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Lp-SK_RUNAWAY", "Ran away from an abusive home at twelve. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Lp-SK_IMMIGRANT", "Family immigrated to Night City seeking opportunity. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Lp-SK_MEGATOWER_KID", "Grew up in the lower floors of a megatower. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Lp-SK_CLUB_KID", "Spent %his% youth in Night City's club scene. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Lp-SK_FIXER_CHILD", "Raised by a fixer who taught %him% the trade. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Lp-SK_FIRST_BOOST", "Boosted %his% first car at thirteen. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Lp-SK_GANG_RUNNER", "Ran errands for the local gang as a kid. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Lp-SK_STREET_FIGHTING", "Got into street fighting to earn eddies. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Lp-SK_NIGHTCLUB_UNDERAGE", "Snuck into nightclubs from age fourteen. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Lp-SK_DEALER_YOUTH", "Started dealing small-time at fifteen. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Lp-SK_PICKPOCKET", "Made ends meet picking pockets in Kabuki. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Lp-SK_GANG_AFFILIATE", "Became affiliated with a gang in %his% teens. ");
        this.Text("Kdsp-Lp-SK_STREET_RACE", "Got into illegal street racing. ");
